        ],
        "text": "According to Christopher G. Browning, Jr., according to Christopher G. Browning, Jr., the case concerns whether Congress expressly provided a limitations period for retaliatory discharge actions under the Federal False Claims Act."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Respondent",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "0fd3acd3905183267b9a327fdc43f1bbff42a486d63308fef30bc7e4da84ff6c",
